FQDN_05.steps:
1. Configure your IPv6 DNS server as DUT system DNS;
2. Check option "Prefer IPv6 DNS Servers" ;
3. Add FQDN AO "split.s20.com", enable packet capture on DUT;
4. Check DNS packets, here test three different cases:
DUT send query, IPv6 DNS server send response, case A: when Reply code: No error (0), Authority RRs:1, check the Minimum TTL value in Authoritative nameservers segment of the response message, maybe 900s =15 mins
case B: when Reply code: No such name (3), Authority RRs:1, check the Minimum TTL value in Authoritative nameservers segment of the response message, maybe 900s =15 mins
case C: when Reply code: No such name (3), Authority RRs:0
check the interval of the next query sent out from DUT

