FQDN_02.steps:
1. Use your own DNS server as DUT system DNS server and now stop DNS service on this DNS server;
2. Enter vxshell in cli, type command "gMaxRetryThreshold=3";
3. Add an FQDN AO, say "split.s20.com";
4. Do packet capture on DUT, capture DNS packets, and wait a while, check Alerts message on system/status page;
5. Go to diag page, enable option "Enable unlimited queries to resolve FQDN objects";
6. Check packet capture, and system status page.

